WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,400
Mr. Li

2
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:04,020
You always say that you are not used to eating Western food with too many rules

3
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:05,740
But I still have to try it occasionally

4
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:07,780
Just take this opportunity today

5
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:09,180
Be familiar with dining etiquette

6
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:10,700
Business banquet in the future

7
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:12,300
It is inevitable to encounter occasions where meals are served separately

8
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:14,180
This money is spent too straightforwardly

9
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:17,380
This is called professional travel, right? You can arrange it accordingly.

10
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:22,870
What is the origin of this person named Li?

11
00:00:23,230 --> 00:00:24,790
There were two security guards with him.

12
00:00:25,270 --> 00:00:26,870
He doesn't look like a big shot.

13
00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:28,350
Maybe it's just a show

14
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:29,550
Find an opportunity to explore the enemy

15
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:32,120
Brother Li is also in business

16
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:33,820
Opened a small company

17
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:36,180
Do something energy-related

18
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:38,220
I made my fortune by relying on energy.

19
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:39,820
Family assets worth hundreds of billions

20
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:42,020
It seems like this guy wants to reach a higher level

21
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:45,340
Mr. Li said which sector specifically is energy?

22
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:46,700
Light amplitude or wind power?

23
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:48,060
The water in this business is very deep

24
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:49,460
You can’t make any money from playing without some resources.

25
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:52,740
After saying that their family is engaged in energy investment, Qinei has a wide network of contacts.

26
00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:54,020
Do you want me to set up a line for you?

27
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:55,300
A word with uncle

28
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:56,700
It’s more effective than if you run the business for half a year
